### Topic 41 - Pagination & Sorting (VS Code "REST Client" extension)
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Default page (page 0, size 10, sorted by id)
GET {{base}}

### First page of 5, most expensive first
GET {{base}}?page=0&size=5&sort=price,desc

### Two sort orders: category A-Z, then price high-low
GET {{base}}?size=8&sort=category,asc&sort=price,desc

### Last page
GET {{base}}?page=11&size=5

### Page beyond the end -> empty content, totals still correct
GET {{base}}?page=99&size=5

### Size too big -> capped at 50 (max-page-size)
GET {{base}}?size=100000

### Sorting by a field that is not allowed -> 400
GET {{base}}?sort=password,asc

### PageRequest built manually from plain parameters
GET {{base}}/manual?page=1&size=3&sortBy=name&direction=desc

### Manual endpoint validates size -> 400
GET {{base}}/manual?size=500

### Paging a derived query
GET {{base}}/category/Books?page=0&size=5&sort=price,asc

### Sort only (top 5 cheapest of a category)
GET {{base}}/category/Books/cheapest

### Slice ("load more") - no COUNT query, only hasNext
GET {{base}}/slice?page=0&size=20

### Slice of one category
GET {{base}}/slice?category=Sports&page=1&size=5

### Search filters + paging + sorting
GET {{base}}/search?category=Electronics&minPrice=50&maxPrice=150&page=0&size=3&sort=price,desc

### Search by text only
GET {{base}}/search?q=book&size=2

### @Query + Pageable
GET {{base}}/low-stock?threshold=5&sort=stock,asc

### Spring's PagedModel JSON shape
GET {{base}}/paged-model?page=1&size=2
